  "title": "Cheeseburger Sliders",
  "description": "These tasty cheeseburger sliders, made with a juicy beef mixture baked on Hawaiian rolls, are loaded with gooey cheese for a delicious appetizer.",
  "authors": [
    "Ashley DeStefano"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-03-05T00:21:11-05:00",
